                <l xml:id="m-dff8cd81-bb23-404e-ac5b-8d3d029f5635" facs="#m-6f804a6a-de24-439e-b73e-86de8b96d6f9" label="ambiguous">na</l><l xml:id="m-18e4898f-8323-4202-a001-ec2abc95a59f" facs="#m-3cec6900-ada3-4093-abdb-6c1071b6463c" label="text-like">The Tones of the Psalms.</l><l xml:id="m-e6752ff5-4897-4e07-b97c-da3bcc0a2a0e" facs="#m-f2490d9a-c672-4657-9826-10d6325811f2" label="ambiguous">Fourth Tone.</l><l xml:id="m-ecef7c4e-701d-485e-b0ae-1d395a0a3e6b" facs="#m-6a5d28d4-8649-4ddf-93d4-33e9335dffd0" label="text-like">Terminations of r accent</l><l xml:id="m-0113d526-5637-44b5-87cd-d47b289715c5" facs="#m-05f5a866-7afc-4c89-9625-11fa1daf2e36" label="text-like">Mediant of i accent with</l><l xml:id="m-c501d81e-bf2d-48ea-a1a5-9868c885a9d9" facs="#m-b3c28e2e-49ca-497f-a629-08b14b48e61c" label="ambiguous">vith a preparatory syllables</l><l xml:id="m-272e781e-5a6f-4611-8fa9-91e90e13e243" facs="#m-a97e2c74-0233-4a67-813b-22fe641a917d" label="ambiguous">"preparatory syllables.</l><l xml:id="m-0f7218e0-cb46-4a69-b14d-03094e9a1c51" facs="#m-ee94c3fe-45d7-4efb-8b28-38f5612ca50b" label="text-like">(In tbe Termination E, the</l><l xml:id="m-087f8f1b-daa4-4456-b85c-c007ee0c1803" facs="#m-ad59d081-505f-4e9b-8236-3580a3a287d6" label="text-like">additignal note o the</l><l xml:id="m-c5880434-f002-45de-a44b-d7a74791e024" facs="#m-1beeff2c-473d-4a45-9551-e027b63e1cad" label="text-like">dactylic cadence is antici¬</l><l xml:id="m-02676ccf-994e-40db-bfb8-2848af5c0ce2" facs="#m-a3785bbd-9e25-41f1-ab50-6b5d16e4ca49" label="text-like">pated vith the accented</l><l xml:id="m-35d534e7-1dad-42b0-8ec7-6cb3cb399338" facs="#m-0b7b9666-9d94-48e6-bbf2-a2a458344356" label="text-like">syllable and precedes the</l><l xml:id="m-aa76dcf7-4f2a-480d-9824-5531aff840f4" facs="#m-840172af-c133-47c8-97da-590aa5541da4" label="ambiguous">Terminations.</l><l xml:id="m-1f4ba8f5-2673-48f1-8857-6231e5c53b23" facs="#m-7fb420da-00b2-477b-b709-f89b13d2f98c" label="ambiguous">divis)</l><l xml:id="m-9b65ed1a-ae9d-4920-9696-9419e03db958" facs="#m-10091e23-b930-40ae-be93-4f7f19994b0f" label="ambiguous">Mediant</l><l xml:id="m-b4550840-96e8-4998-8a29-b9e02c4ef8d1" facs="#m-fbc4b76b-7655-4ddc-a3d8-386732962435" label="text-like">Int. Tenor and Flez</l><l xml:id="m-171b5ea4-80e5-4608-9678-6d217e9c0796" facs="#m-378c555c-fe0b-4af8-8008-e7ed1e12d5a2" label="ambiguous">Tenor</l><l xml:id="m-6506c60b-ac4a-448c-8ede-bf3f3f94ba27" facs="#m-7a1241e3-f9f8-4858-b299-be1e5a82448f" label="lyrics-like">Anotũer porition es the same tone.</l><l xml:id="m-a44bf506-2630-49b6-ac74-c0b49de8f12b" facs="#m-d0af35de-5d8c-4f57-a7b5-530302ca955a" label="ambiguous">a</l><l xml:id="m-cbfe253f-aa1e-4935-a72f-bbe8ab3f07ba" facs="#m-b745e15c-b7ec-4fd9-ad53-dd2c0d88380f" label="ambiguous">Al</l><l xml:id="m-aa051c76-190f-4f64-ab11-8fba012db328" facs="#m-db5d89b4-1a5e-4b12-b6bd-9e208f419183" label="ambiguous">Fifth Tone.</l><l xml:id="m-687f2a60-fcb7-4fe3-b18b-9dd06333181f" facs="#m-e4842979-e763-4546-8208-703c0ccb462f" label="text-like">Termination of z accents.</l><l xml:id="m-21c8e775-4556-4051-acc7-fb77932e0932" facs="#m-66233daa-5c89-43df-a1dd-7f1d5e69586e" label="text-like">Mediant of 1 accent.</l><l xml:id="m-4e76a8d8-28ed-4deb-abc7-9ad040aa5023" facs="#m-1437534f-59c7-4c65-9017-bb12ef29cd13" label="ambiguous">Int.</l><l xml:id="m-75e1794c-0dda-41bd-ba98-3dced7bfe851" facs="#m-e864074c-905b-465e-81ef-afcbf4257f3b" label="ambiguous">Mediant</l><l xml:id="m-5148f651-998c-4afe-82ea-4cd96342712d" facs="#m-b59ca01c-b468-4c54-97ee-7e1ae5426702" label="text-like">Tenor and Flex</l><l xml:id="m-57af3e3b-e984-482c-8e38-186dca341d42" facs="#m-24fc71b7-91fe-4a91-9675-d92bfec546e1" label="ambiguous">Sole ending.</l><l xml:id="m-3aca6c90-0abf-4d8e-bbdc-f6b4454eb9f8" facs="#m-1cc0eb22-d97f-4653-b198-4c12b67b32b0" label="ambiguous">Tenor</l></lg>
